  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="phantombuster-pricing"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">02 / Check the current bill</p><h2>PhantomBuster pricing:<br>when should you keep it?</h2><p>PhantomBuster combines data collection, enrichment and outreach. Compare the limit you hit with what a replacement would cost.</p></div>
    <div class="pb-baseline-grid">{% for p in guide.baselinePlans %}<div class="pb-plan"><h3>{{ p.name }}</h3><p class="pb-price">${{ p.monthly }}<span>/month</span></p><p>{{ p.hours }} execution hours<br>{{ p.slots }} automation slots<br>{{ p.credits }} email credits per month</p><p class="pb-annual">Annual billing: ${{ p.annualEquivalent }}/month equivalent<br>${{ p.annualPayment }} paid yearly</p></div>{% endfor %}</div>
    <p class="sg-sources">USD, shared workspace plans. <a href="https://phantombuster.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PhantomBuster pricing ↗</a> · <a href="https://support.phantombuster.com/hc/en-us/articles/4494623647250-What-Each-PhantomBuster-Plan-Includes-Features-Limits-and-Pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plan allowances ↗</a></p>
    <div class="sg-two sg-after"><div><h3>Hours and credits pay for different things.</h3><p>Execution hours cover automation running time. Email-discovery credits pay for lookup attempts, including unsuccessful ones. Running out of execution time pauses the automations until a reset or upgrade; there is no automatic overage charge.</p><p class="sg-sources"><a href="https://support.phantombuster.com/hc/en-us/articles/4415010168594-How-to-Choose-the-Right-PhantomBuster-Plan-for-your-Goals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Runtime limits ↗</a> · <a href="https://support.phantombuster.com/hc/en-us/articles/28583518589202-How-Email-Discovery-Works-and-Why-Some-Emails-Might-Be-Missing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How email credits work ↗</a></p></div><div><h3>Can PhantomBuster find phone numbers?</h3><p>Yes. Its Chrome lead panel can reveal phone numbers when available. The panel works on standard LinkedIn profiles; it does not work on Sales Navigator pages. Check the numbers returned for your buyers before buying capacity around it.</p><p class="sg-sources"><a href="https://phantombuster.com/chrome-extension" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Phone-data feature ↗</a> · <a href="https://support.phantombuster.com/hc/en-us/articles/27815149833618-How-to-Install-and-Use-the-PhantomBuster-Browser-Extension" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lead-panel limits ↗</a></p></div></div>
    <div class="pb-verdict-strip"><p class="lp-kicker">CallTeam's verdict on PhantomBuster</p><p>Keep it when the workflows produce usable leads at a sensible cost. Paying $439 a month to solve an occasional export problem is poor value.</p></div>
